OL,3,GNEWSAFour youths charged over wrong-way
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour youths have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with a crash on Dublin's M50
OL,8,Fin which a man in his 20s was seriously
OL,9,Finjured.
OL,11,FA vehicle travelling the wrong way
OL,12,Fcollided head-on with his car near
OL,13,Fjunction 12 at Firhouse on 9 August.
OL,15,FSeven youths were arrested by gardai
OL,16,F(Irish police) in Tallaght on Wednesday
OL,17,Fmorning. Three remain in custody.
OL,19,FThe four charged are due to appear in
OL,20,Fcourt in Dublin on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
